{
    "text": "DON PEDRO is Prince of Arragon. DON JOHN is his bastard Brother. CLAUDIO is a young Lord of Florence. BENEDICK is a young Lord of Padua. LEONATO is Governor of Messina. ANTONIO is his Brother. BALTHASAR is Servant to Don Pedro. BORACHIO is follower of Don John. CONRADE is follower of Don John. DOGBERRY is a Constable. VERGES is a Headborough. FRIAR FRANCIS. is a character. A Sexton. is a character. A Boy. is a character. HERO is Daughter to Leonato. BEATRICE is Niece to Leonato. MARGARET is Waiting gentlewoman attending on Hero. URSULA is Waiting gentlewoman attending on Hero. Messengers is Watch, Attendants, etc.",
